    "visible_text": "Motorcycles Offers Finance Dealers FAQ About Contact Test Ride Book Now Financing Solutions Motorcycle Finance & EMI Plans Transparent rates, minimal documentation, and quick approvals through our trusted banking partners. How Is Your EMI Calculated? Equated Monthly Instalment (EMI) is calculated using the standard reducing balance loan formula: EMI = [P × R × (1 + R)^N] / [(1 + R)^N - 1] P (Principal Loan Amount): Ex-showroom price minus your down payment. R (Monthly Interest Rate): Annual interest rate divided by 12 and then by 100. N (Loan Tenure): Loan duration in total number of months (typically 12 to 72 months). * On-road costs (RTO registration and insurance) can also be bundled into the loan with select banking partners. Banking Partners Official Banking Partners & Interest Rates Our approved banking consortium provides customized two-wheeler loan solutions with fast turnaround times. Banking Partner Interest Rate (p.a.) Maximum Loan Tenure Typical Down Payment HDFC Bank 8.5 % 60 months 0-20% ICICI Bank 9 % 72 months 0-20% SBI 7.9 % 60 months 10-20% Axis Bank 9.5 % 48 months 0-15% Model Estimates Per-Model EMI Estimates Representative 48-month financing breakdown for each Apex Moto model (base variant). Thunderstrike 650 Adventure Ex-showroom: ₹4,20,000 Down Payment Interest Rate Tenure Monthly EMI ₹42,000 9.99 % 48 mo ₹9,585 Basis: Base variant ex-showroom minus down payment, 48 months View Motorcycle Book Test Ride Phantom 350 Classic Ex-showroom: ₹2,15,000 Down Payment Interest Rate Tenure Monthly EMI ₹22,000 9.99 % 48 mo ₹4,894 Basis: Base variant ex-showroom minus down payment, 48 months View Motorcycle Book Test Ride Storm 200 Street Ex-showroom: ₹1,45,000 Down Payment Interest Rate Tenure Monthly EMI ₹14,000 9.49 % 48 mo ₹3,291 Basis: Base variant ex-showroom minus down payment, 48 months View Motorcycle Book Test Ride Zenith 450 Scrambler Scrambler Ex-showroom: ₹3,35,000 Down Payment Interest Rate Tenure Monthly EMI ₹34,000 9.99